|Here's an abuse I just thought of.  What if you had a great character
|who died on level 30, say.  My UNIX version would generate the file
|bones.30.  Could I move or copy that file to bones.5, say?  Would it
|being a maze level cause problems?  What about copying a bones file
|from a non-maze level to a lower Dlvl?  I guess all the monsters
|would get copied with it, but, if you could find the bones pile 
|first ...
